# Cloudflare Pages headers. The academy's live examples (`::: pyscript` frames, an opaque
# origin) and every pyscript.json fetch the wheel cross-origin, so /dist/ answers CORS.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
/dist/*
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
